# Dark Endurance: "this spell costs {1} less to cast if it targets a blocking creature". Bot2's Ornithopter blocks Bot1's Savannah
# Lions on turn 3. Before it blocks, one Mox Jet cannot pay {1}{B} for it; once it blocks, {B} is enough. It is 2/2 and
# indestructible: it kills the Lions (2 damage) and survives its 2 damage. At turn 5 it is a 0/2 again.

